                not yet tested against live Kafka
Next milestone: run explode job end-to-end with Redpanda,
                verify adsb.tracks populated,
                then implement FlightStateMachine

## PostGIS Schema Style
Hybrid approach: typed columns for core fields,
JSONB properties column for flexible attributes.
GIN index on properties for efficient JSONB queries.
Special location attributes (mro, boneyard, grey_market_hub)
stored in airports.properties JSONB column.


Always use Plan mode unless explicitly instructed otherwise.
Do not switch to Agent mode autonomously.
